Hello to the world of fonts:

	The way to generate fonts is via f. You must extract
the character files into C??? and S??? (for ascii fonts).
The latest whereabouts of these is in the file `where'.
`F' has to be fed a script. `small' is used to generate
small (ascii) fonts. `special' will help get the special characters
needed for the ascii fonts. `spec' is a shell script for generating
a complete special font.
